 aluminum cone and low loss rubber surround show no sign of the familiar 500-1500 Hz cone edge resonance and distortion assosiated with soft cones. A bumped back plate in the magnet system, together with the very long and light weight copper clad aluminum voice coil, allow extreme coil excursion with low distortion. A heavy copper ring below the T-shaped pole piece reduces non linear and modula- tion distortion. Extremely stiff and stable injection moulded metal basket, keeps the critical compo- nents in perfect alignment. Large windows in the basket both above and below the spider reduce sound reflection, air flow noise and cavity resonance to a minimum. This driver use Seas SpiderRing® technology.","read_precision":0.005,"read_value":0.33}},"state":"E","value":0.33},"Re_ohm":{"corroboration":"UNMATCHED","dq_calculated":[],"dq_scraper":[],"origin":"manufacturer_datasheet","readings":{"manufacturer_datasheet":{"actual_reading":"3.1 Ohms","read_precision":0.05,"read_value":3.1}},"state":"E","value":3.1},"Rme_kg_per_s":{"dq_calculated":[],"state":"C","value":8.993222338355203},"Rms_kg_per_s":{"corroboration":"UNMATCHED","dq_calculated":[{"detail":"Rms_kg_per_s, Fs_hz, Mms_kg, Qms disagree by 19.5%: Rms = 2π·Fs·Mms/Qms. Every field in the group is marked - correct one of them, or clear one to let it be calculated.","kind":"calc","params":{"actual":1.88,"expected":1.479404540508648,"fields":["Rms_kg_per_s","Fs_hz","Mms_kg","Qms"],"formula":"Rms = 2π·Fs·Mms/Qms","relative":0.1954129041603025,"target":"Rms_kg_per_s"},"rule":"inconsistent-inputs","severity":"error"}],"dq_scraper":[],"origin":"manufacturer_datasheet","readings":{"manufacturer_datasheet":{"actual_reading":"1.88 Ns/m","read_precision":0.005,"read_value":1.88}},"state":"E","value":1.88},"SPL_dB":{"corroboration":"UNMATCHED","dq_calculated":[],"dq_scraper":[],"origin":"manufacturer_datasheet","readings":{"manufacturer_datasheet":{"actual_reading":"88 dB","note":"2.83V/1m","read_precision":0.5,"read_value":88}},